    <h1 id="wb-cont">Canada Gazette, Part&nbsp;II: Volume 160</h1>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-12">
            <p>Browse and read editions of the Canada Gazette, Part&nbsp;II. This part contains all enacted regulations and statutory instruments. Regular editions are published every second Wednesday and are available online at 9&nbsp;am eastern time.</p>
